# ⚡ Alli Ops AI WebGL

An immersive WebGL-powered AI dashboard built with Spline, React, and modern frontend tooling.

## 🚀 Features

- 🌌 Interactive 3D homepage (Spline)
- 🔐 Authentication system (login/logout)
- 📊 Dashboard UI
- 🤖 AI-powered assistant panel
- 🎯 Smooth animations + immersive UX
- ⚡ Built with Vite + React

---

## 🧱 Tech Stack

- React
- Vite
- Spline (3D WebGL)
- OpenAI API
- Context API (Auth)
- CSS / Tailwind (optional)

---

## 📦 Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/alli-ops-ai-webgl.git
cd alli-ops-ai-webgl
npm install
npm run dev



